1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,619
Your body is replacing 4 million cells every second

2
00:00:05,619 --> 00:00:11,237
That is 330 billion cells a day

3
00:00:11,237 --> 00:00:17,558
Most of it is blood

4
00:00:17,558 --> 00:00:23,177
"Every cell is replaced every 7 years"

5
00:00:23,177 --> 00:00:30,551
It depends entirely on the tissue

6
00:00:30,551 --> 00:00:34,238
The body you had yesterday is mostly gone.

7
00:00:34,238 --> 00:00:37,750
The mind that remembers it is not.
